#!/usr/bin/dyalogscript

⎕IO←1
⎕SE.(⍎⊃2⎕FIX'/StartupSession.aplf',⍨2⎕NQ#'GetEnvironment' 'DYALOG')

⍝ Load Tatin dependencies: Jarvis (runtime) and HttpCommand (tests only).
⍝ Packages are fetched on first run, as listed in each folder's apl-dependencies.txt.
{}⎕SE.UCMD 'Tatin.Version' ⍝ make sure Tatin is loaded into ⎕SE
LoadDeps←{
    installed←1∊⊃1 ⎕NINFO⍠1⊢⍵,'/*'
    _←{⎕SE.Tatin.ReInstallDependencies ⍵}⍣(~installed)⊢⍵
    ⎕SE.Tatin.LoadDependencies ⍵ #
}
{}LoadDeps¨'../packages' '../packages_dev'

⍝ Load framework (must sit alongside Jarvis)
⎕SE.Link.Import '#' '../APLSource'

⍝ Load mocks
⎕SE.Link.Import '#.Mocks' './Mocks'

⍝ Load test runner
⎕SE.Link.Import '#' './RunHelper.apln'

⍝ ── Unit Tests ──
⎕←'=== Unit Tests ==='
⎕SE.Link.Import '#.Unit' './Unit'
(uPass uFail)←#.RunHelper.Run #.Unit

⍝ ── Integration Tests ──
⎕←''
⎕←'=== Integration Tests ==='
⎕SE.Link.Import '#' '../Examples'
port←19876
app←⎕NEW #.ExampleClass.ExampleApp
router←app.GetStark
router.ThreadMode←'DEBUG'
app.Start port
⎕DL 1

⎕SE.Link.Import '#.Integration' './Integration'
#.Integration.BaseURL←'http://localhost:',(⍕port)
(iPass iFail)←#.RunHelper.Run #.Integration

:Trap 0
    app.Stop
:EndTrap
⍝ ── Summary ──
⎕←''
⎕←'=== Summary ==='
⎕←'Unit:        ',(⍕uPass),' passed, ',(⍕uFail),' failed'
⎕←'Integration: ',(⍕iPass),' passed, ',(⍕iFail),' failed'

:If 0<uFail+iFail
    ⎕←'FAILED'
    ⎕OFF 1
:Else
    ⎕←'ALL PASSED'
    ⎕OFF 0
:EndIf
